    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Marie-Josée St-Onge",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107569655495329590466/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV5pkEa2zejDrrXbKlY-mBWZJdhoujkjwBm0FNXHuXShfKwWppM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I have always tried to encourage Canadian companies and I have been buying from Clement for a long time. (3 kids) Today's experience at this store gave me such a bad taste. They are so rude, and they don't know how to treat their clients. I was supposed to receive a $50 gift card from a promo for spending $200. \"My mistake\" was that one pair didn't fit my daughter, so I had to return it and bought right away the right size. They argued with me that it needed to be on the same bill for the promo.  Honestly, I didn't have the energy to argue more. They can keep their $50 (I would have probably spent more with it). They lost a long-time client.",
        "time": 1760891618,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "jujhar singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113393945272847331879/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzsU0f71A3RxH1SrvP-YRThl1CnPCJP8unQkWHRf9wqIj7bfCw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Two employees on Tuesday evening are the rudest customer service people I have ever met.\n\nThey were rude and asked us to pay before 5:30 exact, one lady stood at the door and asked us to leave at exact 5:30 and shut the door behind us.\n\nOther lady at cash, I left something I dont want on hanger and she said I cannot leave trash everywhere in store. When I mentioned this is not nice, she said vice versa.\n\nAbsolute horrifying experience and we spent $200 to deserve this service.\n\nI would give zero customer service star if I could. I felt helpless, I wish there is someone they should answerable to. No wonder no body visit Vaudreuil store.",
        "time": 1757475681,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nina Ricci Gutierrez",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112870220463178975633/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJBBdNWYX8ZnqArpHkf-FNH7-XJxFIbfHwWRv-PKIUw0ALLvw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Rude employee. Customer service is non existent.\n\nI asked a question to one of the employees but my toddler is throwing a fit and did not  finish our conversation. I settled my toddler first and asked another employee the same question. The first employee yelled at me and was very rude and told me i asked the same question already. Is asking the same question not allowed? I left the store in tears.",
        "time": 1762283453,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jasmine Kaur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104418812853411223096/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIDugKJfkqTE06Of70c3E4KvqHMO_mSjKRprgCWDcBUImJFug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Horrible customer service, two ladies dont even know the C of customer service.\n\nThey would stare at you, and wont help. If you ask them to be nice, they would yell at you.\n\nThey wont let you bill if you are 1 minute over closing time and have all your stuff picked up. They lie that their system shuts down at 5:30 if store closing at 5:30 PM.\n\nBoth of them are very disrespectful and we felt so helpless. Its pity that store with such good collection would allow this. I will never visit there again.",
        "time": 1757524847,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "MissusMeow22",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112319707101898887378/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWQYx2i3U2njo2P60TrCTiKlTo3hCtM0CHvW52qKwncHa_IY4G=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "One of my favourite clothing stores, I can always find what we want and  more. The service is great making our shopping  always enjoyable.",
        "time": 1621599699,
        "translated": false
      }
